flowchart LR
    A[(Raw electoral<br/>bulletins · PDF)] -->|Claude API| B[Segment by<br/>candidate]
    B -->|Yomitoku OCR| C[Extract metadata<br/>and text]
    C --> D[(Pandas<br/>dataframe)]
    D --> E([Text complexity<br/>measures])
    D --> F([Structural topic<br/>model])
    D --> G([Party centrality<br/> measure])

    classDef data fill:#fff8e1,stroke:#f9a825,color:#4e342e
    classDef process fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0,color:#0d2a4a
    classDef analysis fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#1b3d1f
    class A,D data
    class B,C process
    class E,F,G analysis
